  "abstract": "Covers the IETF HTTPAPI RateLimit header fields draft, pinned to draft-ietf-httpapi-ratelimit-headers-11 with a build posture: the RateLimit-Policy and RateLimit fields, their Structured Fields syntax (RFC 9651), and their use with Retry-After (RFC 9110), 429 Too Many Requests (RFC 6585) and the draft's problem types for RFC 9457 bodies. SKILL.md holds the invariants and workflow; references split out field syntax, server, client and intermediary behavior with security considerations, and examples with a TypeScript serializer and parser.",
